tools.description:
Configure fan tuning settings to control cooling behavior. Use this when the user wants to adjust fan speeds, create custom fan curves, set quiet operation modes, or optimize cooling performance. Pass null to reset to default for each settings.
For 'fan_tuning', provide a dictionary mapping state indices to (fan_speed, temperature) tuples, for instances:
    1. quiet fan tuning argument: {"0": [20, 60], "1": [25, 70], "2": [30, 80], "3": [35, 90], "4": [40, 100]}
    2. balanced fan tuning argument: {"0": [30, 50], "1": [50, 60], "2": [70, 70], "3": [90, 80], "4": [100, 100]}
    3. performance fan tuning argument: {"0": [40, 40], "1": [60, 50], "2": [80, 60], "3": [100, 70], "4": [100, 100]}
